<title>BELGIUM: EU sets duty on cane molasses imports.</title>
<headline>EU sets duty on cane molasses imports.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union (EU) set a duty of 0.01 Ecus per 100 kg on imports of cane molasses, compared with zero duty previously, an EU member-state official said on Friday.</p>
<p>Duties on imports of beet molasses remain suspended.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for cane molasses was set at 8.20 Ecus per 100 kg, compared with 8.32 Ecus previously.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for beet molasses was fixed at 11.96 Ecus per 100 kg, against 12.13 Ecus previously.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Bureau +322 287 6830</p>
